;: modes.lca (3042PC84-70), hand-written: logic-block function modes
Version 2
Design 3042PC84 9 0
Speed -70
Editblk DC
Base F
Config X:F Y:F F:A:B:C:D:E DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = A*B+C*D*~E
Endblk
Editblk DD
Base FGM
Config X:M Y: F:A:B G:C:D DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = A*~B
Equate G = C@D
Endblk
Editblk DE
Base FG
Config X:F Y:G F:A:B G:C:D DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = A+B
Equate G = ~C*D
Endblk
Editblk DF
Base F
Config X:F Y: F:E:B:C DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = ~(~C*~B*E)
Endblk
Editblk DG
Base F
Config X: Y:F F:A:D:E DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = A*D+~E
Endblk
Editblk P77
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P78
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P79
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P80
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P81
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P82
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P83
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P84
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P2
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P3
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P4
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Addnet I0 P77.I DC.A DD.A DE.A DG.A
Addnet I1 P78.I DC.B DD.B DE.B DF.B
Addnet I2 P79.I DC.C DD.C DE.C DF.C
Addnet I3 P80.I DC.D DD.D DE.D DG.D
Addnet I4 P81.I DC.E DD.E DF.E DG.E
Addnet O0 DC.X P82.O
Addnet O1 DD.X P83.O
Addnet O2 DE.X P84.O
Addnet O3 DE.Y P2.O
Addnet O4 DF.X P3.O
Addnet O5 DG.Y P4.O
